OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright end to the day with some
OL,7,Fpleasant evening sunshine. Cloud is
OL,8,Fexpected to increase through the night
OL,9,Fwith some outbreaks of rain possible.
OL,10,FCloud is expected to lower through the
OL,11,Fearly hours, particularly over hills.
OL,12,FMild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FA cloudy start to Monday with
OL,15,Fcloud lifting and breaking somewhat by
OL,16,Fafternoon. Some bright or sunny spells
OL,17,Fpossible, most likely further south.
OL,18,FAnother rather warm and humid day
OL,19,Fahead.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
